  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ginger Production and Marketing Expansion in Koloko</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Ginger.Beneficiaries: 317 (0 women).Description: The group seeks to increase the area under cultivation and improve farmers access to mechanized production equipment and inputs to increase production; shift to fully organic production; organize marketing through grouped sales to increase prices; and develop commercial partnerships to expand market access.</narrative>
  </description>
